        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/storykit-meta.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Meta has quietly released a new iPhone app that uses AI to create personalized children’s stories, complete with illustrations, narration, and original music.</p>",
        "type": "Technology",
        "source": "9to5Mac"
