        "title": "Poor Yoshi",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/213897/Poor-Yoshi",
        "content_text": "It will take about 46 minutes of your life, but <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y1jwZekUBjo\">watching Revolug speedrun</a> the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaizo\">Kaizo</a> Mario Mod <a href=\"https://www.smwcentral.net/?p=section&amp;a=details&amp;id=41022\">Super Dram World 3</a> at <a href=\"https://gamesdonequick.com/schedule/66\">Summer Games Done Quick 2026</a> (as creator <a href=\"https://pangaeapanga.net:52443/PangaSite/\">Panga</a> commentates and <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/spikevegeta\">spikevegeta</a> react to seeing it for the first time) will make you gasp in awe if you've ever missed a jump in a platformer.",
        "type": "Internet",
